#: configdialog.cpp:49
msgid "&General"
msgstr "&Töptän"

#: configdialog.cpp:52
msgid "Ac&tions"
msgstr "Ğä&mällär"

#: configdialog.cpp:55
msgid "&Shortcuts"
msgstr "&Çaptırğıç"

#: configdialog.cpp:99
msgid "&Popup menu at mouse-cursor position"
msgstr "&Atılma saylaqnı küse uqı urında çığarası"

#: configdialog.cpp:101
msgid "Save clipboard contents on e&xit"
msgstr "Çıqqan çaqta alışukesä eçtälegen &saqlísı"

#: configdialog.cpp:103
msgid "Remove whitespace when executing actions"
msgstr "Eşne cibärgändä buşlıqlar beteräse"

#: configdialog.cpp:105
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the selected text has some whitespace at the end, which, if loaded "
"as URL in a browser would cause an error. Enabling this option removes any "
"whitespace at the beginning or end of the selected string (the original "
"clipboard contents will not be modified)."
msgstr ""
"Eçendä buşlıq bilgeläre bulğan saylanğan yazmanı gizgeçtä URL itep açqanda xata "
"kilep çığuı bar. Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, saylanğan yazmanıñ başında da, "
"azağında da bulğan buşlıqlar töşereläçäk (alışukesä eçtälege üzgärelmi "
"qalaçaq)."

#: configdialog.cpp:107
msgid "&Replay actions on an item selected from history"
msgstr "Uzğannar arasında saylanğan keremnärne qabat &uynat"

#: configdialog.cpp:110
msgid "Pre&vent empty clipboard"
msgstr "Alışukesäne &aldan buşatası"

#: configdialog.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be emptied. "
"E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be emptied."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, alışu kesä berqayçan da buşatılmayaçaq, ü.ö. "
"yazılımnardan çıqqanda alışukesä küp oçraqlarda buşatıla."

#: configdialog.cpp:117
msgid "&Ignore selection"
msgstr "Saylanuğa &qaramasqa"

#: configdialog.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torğanda saylanğan närsälär alışukesä köndälegenä eläkmi, "
"yäğni anıq üzgäreşlär genä  yazıla."

#: configdialog.cpp:123
msgid "Clipboard/Selection Behavior"
msgstr "Alışukesä/Saylaw Eşläwe"

#: configdialog.cpp:127
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers available:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something and pressing Ctrl+C, or "
"by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar or menubar."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Selection</b> is available immediately after selecting some text. The "
"only way to access the selection is to press the middle mouse button."
"<br>"
"<br>You can configure the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Alışukesäneñ ike töre bar:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Alışukesä</b> anı tutıru öçen, berärnärsä saylap yä Ctrl+C basası, yä "
"qoraltirädä/saylaqta \"İskä al\" östenä çirtäse."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Saylaw</b> berärnärsä saylanğaç ul şunda uq ireşmäle bulaçaq. Ul çaqta "
"saylanmağa küseneñ üzäk töymäse aşa ğına ireşep bula."
"<br>"
"<br>Şul ike alışukesä arasında bäyläneşne bu köylämä aşa caylap bula.</qt>"

#: configdialog.cpp:138
msgid "Sy&nchronize contents of the clipboard and the selection"
msgstr "&Saylanu eçtälege belän alışukesä eçtätelegen tiñ totası"

#: configdialog.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Selecting this option synchronizes these two buffers, so they work the same way "
"as in KDE 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, bu ike eşxäter çordaş kileş totılaçaq, yäğni KDE "
"1.x-2.x astında kebek eşläyäçäk."

#: configdialog.cpp:145
msgid "Separate clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Alışukeşäne saylanudan ayır"

#: configdialog.cpp:148
msgid ""
"Using this option will only set the selection when highlighting something and "
"the clipboard when choosing e.g. \"Copy\" in a menubar."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq bulsa, alışukesä eçtälege saylanudan bäysez bulaçaq, yäğni "
"saylaqta \"İskä al\" kereme aşa ğına anıñ eçtälegen üzgärtep bula."

#: configdialog.cpp:155
msgid "Tim&eout for action popups:"
msgstr "Atılma &eşen kötterü:"

#: configdialog.cpp:157
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: configdialog.cpp:158
msgid "A value of 0 disables the timeout"
msgstr "0 itep quyu kiçektterüne sünderä"

#: configdialog.cpp:161
msgid "C&lipboard history size:"
msgstr "A&lışukesä uzğanınıñ küläme:"

#: configdialog.cpp:183
msgid ""
"_n:  entry\n"
" entries"
msgstr " kerem"

#: configdialog.cpp:229
msgid "Action &list (right click to add/remove commands):"
msgstr "Ğämäl &tezmäse (boyırıq östäw/beterü uñ-çirtü aşa):"

#: configdialog.cpp:233
msgid "Regular Expression (see http://doc.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"
msgstr ""
"Tärtip Çağılışı (bonda qara: http://doc.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"

#: configdialog.cpp:234
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Açıqlama"

#: configdialog.cpp:286
msgid "&Use graphical editor for editing regular expressions"
msgstr "Tärtip çağılışın tözü öçen täräzäle tözätkeç &qullanası"

#: configdialog.cpp:295
msgid "&Add Action"
msgstr "Ğämäl &Östäw..."

#: configdialog.cpp:298
msgid "&Delete Action"
msgstr "Ğämälne &Beter"

#: configdialog.cpp:301
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Click on a highlighted item's column to change it. \"%s\" in a command will be "
"replaced with the clipboard contents."
msgstr ""
"Saylanğan kerem buyına çirtep, anı üzgärtep bula. Boyırıqtağı \"%s\" alışu kesä "
"eçtälege belän almaşınaçaq."

#: configdialog.cpp:307
msgid "Advanced..."
msgstr "Kiñäytep..."

#: configdialog.cpp:332
msgid "Add Command"
msgstr "Boyırıq Östä"

#: configdialog.cpp:333
msgid "Remove Command"
msgstr "Beter Boyırıqnı"

#: configdialog.cpp:343
msgid "Click here to set the command to be executed"
msgstr "Bu boyırıqnı eşlätü öçen bonda törtäse"

#: configdialog.cpp:344
msgid "<new command>"
msgstr "<yaña boyırıq>"

#: configdialog.cpp:366
msgid "Click here to set the regexp"
msgstr "Bu regexp'nı quyu öçen bonda törtäse"

#: configdialog.cpp:367
msgid "<new action>"
msgstr "<yaña ğämäl>"

#: configdialog.cpp:407
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Östämä Caylawlar"

#: configdialog.cpp:424
msgid "D&isable Actions for Windows of Type WM_CLASS"
msgstr "WM_CLASS Törlektä Täräzälär öçen Eşlär Sünderü"

#: configdialog.cpp:427
msgid ""
"<qt>This lets you specify windows in which Klipper should not invoke "
"\"actions\". Use"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>"
"<br>in a terminal to find out the WM_CLASS of a window. Next, click on the "
"window you want to examine. The first string it outputs after the equal sign is "
"the one you need to enter here.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Bonda äytelgän täräzälär öçen \"Eşlär\" digän saylaq kürsätü sünderelä. "
"Terminalda"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>"
"<br>boyırığın cibärep, berär täräzä östenä çirtü aşa anıñ sínıfın belep bula. "
"Berençe yulda kürsäteläçäk bäyäne bonda kertäse dä.</qt>"

